The drawingml/wordart-fonts.tsv resource contains outlines and advances derived
from the existing modified Roboto Medium and Bold fonts, copyright Google Inc.,
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The source font byte hashes are recorded
in the resource header. Existing font modifications are documented in
viewer-core/src/main/resources/NOTICE.md. The offline generator decomposes
composite glyphs and emits quadratic outlines; no font library ships with it.
Generator: tools/formats/generate_wordart_fonts.py
These licences apply to the data, not to UFO's proprietary engines.
Licence: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Supplemental WordArt outlines
-----------------------------
The drawingml/wordart-fallback.tsv resource contains regular Latin, Hebrew consonants and
heart/suit glyph outlines derived from the existing Liberation Sans 2.1.5
Regular and Bold fonts. Source byte hashes are recorded in the resource.
The derived resource is named UFO supplemental outline data. Reserved font
names are used only to identify upstream sources. Its licence and copyright
notice follow, also embedded in drawingml/wordart-OFL.txt.
